{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 在部分段落把心理过程压缩得更短、更确定，例如 S06 把“没急着”变成“没再”，S10 把“慢慢觉得”变成“明白”，人物内心犹疑的细微层次不如 Y 保留得充分。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的重点加亮让人更容易一眼抓住每段的核心变化，感受又按音乐时点出现，不必一次面对所有短词，尤其 S03、S13 的优势明显。它的音乐描述也更具体，能让人感到情绪如何随着旋律、节奏和身体状态变化。Y 在心理动机的叙述上更完整，保留了更多犹疑和自我解释，但整体而言，X 更适合边听边扫，也更容易把各段感受串成一个完整的心理历程。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "43582e94-112f-4381-a945-e5d0db3817b4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T054450224034Z", "elapsed_seconds": 104.969, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:46:35.211142+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a3319fda0672600489947475811c88e484a1023cd2418151c32fc4405896a1e6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\ch